Dear Sir or Madam,

I write to notify you of Judicial Review proceedings issued in Zahmoul v SS=
J & HMCTS (AC-2025-LON-004293).
The claim concerns systemic administrative failures within HMCTS, including=
 the handling of court-controlled electronic material and participation issu=
es for a vulnerable litigant.

This notification is provided for transparency only; I am not making a judi=
cial misconduct complaint.

Kind regards,
Nadia Zahmoul

=20

